+### Parameters and Loss Functions
+The optimization minimizes a composite loss function. The specific weights and learning rates are:
 
 **Learning Rates:**
-*   Density ($\sigma$): $\eta_\sigma = 30$ [S1].
-*   Spherical Harmonic Coefficients ($c$): $\eta_c = 10^{-2}$ [S1].
+*   Density values ($\sigma$): 30 [S1].
+*   Spherical Harmonic coefficients: $10^{-2}$ [S1].
 
-**Regularization Weights ($\lambda$):**
-*   Foreground Density TV: $\lambda_{\sigma, fg} = 5.0 \times 10^{-5}$ [S1].
-*   Foreground SH TV: $\lambda_{c, fg} = 5.0 \times 10^{-3}$ [S1].
-*   Background Color TV: $\lambda_{color, bg} = 1.0 \times 10^{-3}$ [S1].
-*   Background Density TV: $\lambda_{\sigma, bg} = 1.0 \times 10^{-3}$ [S1].
-*   Beta Loss: $\lambda_{\beta} = 10^{-5}$ [S1].
-*   Sparsity Loss: $\lambda_{sparsity} = 10^{-10}$ [S1]. Note: This is 10 times larger than the default Plenoxels configuration [S1].
+**Loss Weights ($\lambda$):**
+*   Total Variation (TV) loss for foreground densities: $5.0 \times 10^{-5}$ [S1].
+*   Total Variation (TV) loss for foreground SH coefficients: $5.0 \times 10^{-3}$ [S1].
+*   Total Variation (TV) loss for background colors: $1.0 \times 10^{-3}$ [S1].
+*   Total Variation (TV) loss for background densities: $1.0 \times 10^{-3}$ [S1].
+*   Beta loss: $10^{-5}$ [S1].
+*   Sparsity loss: $10^{-10}$ (10 times larger than the default configuration) [S1].
 
 **Other Parameters:**
-*   Background Brightness: $0.5$ [S1].
+*   Background brightness: 0.5 [S1].
 
